<h3><u>Aa ali Asghar</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>tujhko jo paaun ay mere asghar, jhoola jhulaun aa mere asghar<br />
jhoola jhulaun lori sunaun, doodh pilaun aa mere asghar</p>

<p>mere mujahid mere sipahi, khatm huvi maidaan may ladaai<br />
ghar ko sidharo maa ko pukaro, mai chain paaun aa mere asghar<br />
tujhko jo paaun....</p>

<p>yaad aa rahi hai masoom baatein, din may sukun hai bechain raate<br />
ji na sakungi roti rahungi, aansu bahao aa mere asghar<br />
tujhko jo paaun....</p>

<p>pooch rahi hai bali sakina, kyon nahi aaya laut ke bhaiya<br />
tu hi batade maidan se aake, mai kya bataun aa mere asghar<br />
tujhko jo paaun....</p>

<p>pehre huve hai shaam ke saaye, ab to parinde bhi laut aaye<br />
mai ro rahi hoo jaan kho rahi hoo, tujko sulaaun aa mere asghar<br />
tujhko jo paaun....</p>

<p>zakhmi gala aur pyaas ki shiddat, hoti to hogi maa ki zuroorat<br />
tu jo pukare dil ke sahare, mai daudi aaun aa mere asghar<br />
tujhko jo paaun....</p>

<p>mehsoos mujko ye ho raha hai, jaise ke jhoola bhi ro raha hai<br />
ay mere beta ye rota jhoola, kaise Jhulaaun aa mere asghar<br />
tujhko jo paaun....</p>

<p>pyaas bujhaane nehr kanare, jab se gaye ho ay mere pyare<br />
dar sa laga hai dil doobta hai, palkein bichaaun aa mere asghar<br />
maktal se aaye aise khabar</p>

<p>makhtal se aayi kaisi khabar hai, kurta lahoo se sab tera tar hai<br />
teer laga hai zakhmi gala hai, mai mar na jaaun aa mere asghar<br />
tujhko jo paaun....</p>

<p>rehaan-o-sarwar banu ke lab par, ek sada thi ay mere asghar<br />
sooni hai jungal hai gham ka badal tujko chupaun aa mere asghar<br />
tujhko jo paaun....</p>
</p>